{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/190d0a0d08c46176f8c4499a63f3e035.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken\u2019s Bar is a 4-player online drinking card game set in a pirate tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round ends with a toast and someone blacking out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kraken mixes the drinks, you play the cards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/9f0b64b300975e88013206028cd2879d.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a card, pass your hand to the left, take from the right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the deadliest mix you can avoid drinking yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the toast is called, all drink together, the highest score is eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy at Kraken\u2019s Bar.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/9bc14fe50ea6e8f982f6440d7a3bf557.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/c1dc50f94627e343275d08dfe8a3e0c6.poster.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/c1dc50f94627e343275d08dfe8a3e0c6.webm?t=1767447858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/c1dc50f94627e343275d08dfe8a3e0c6.mp4?t=1767447858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drink changes how cards score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some double, some drop to zero, some twist your whole plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the effects, trick the others if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/f88c171b09bbf8ab611f594d97b2c33b.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/dde94339133631b1ce4f44e8a2f78c74.poster.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/dde94339133631b1ce4f44e8a2f78c74.webm?t=1767447858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/dde94339133631b1ce4f44e8a2f78c74.mp4?t=1767447858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands keep moving around the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The very cards you tried to ditch might crawl back or straight into your drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick matches keep you saying, \u201cOne more, mate!\u201d again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/3ce6c6d95d242f6be71e40f4c800f97f.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861910/extras/7753e5eba0bd1657133055ba61ad1047.poster.avif?t=1767447858\" width=600 height=338 